                       },
                       {
                           "text":  "News from the depots, the fleet and the people who keep them running.",
                           "page":  1,
                           "line":  2,
                           "endPage":  1,
                           "listString":  "",
                           "inTable":  false
                       },
                       {
                           "text":  "The warehouse team moved the last of the old racking out in the spring, and the new layout has already cut the distance walked on an average shift. Orders now leave the floor in the order the vans are loaded, which has shortened the morning queue at the gates and given drivers a clearer idea of when they will be away. The warehouse team moved the last of the old racking out in the spring, and the new layout has already cut the distance walked on an average shift. Orders now leave the floor in the order the vans are loaded, which has shortened the morning queue at the gates and given drivers a clearer idea of when they will be away. ",
